@IncludePresenca.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5045

GET {{IncludePresenca.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

@token = COLE_UM_JWT_AQUI
@eventoId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@membroId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Listar presenças do evento (Diretoria)
GET {{IncludePresenca.Api_HostAddress}}/api/eventos/{{eventoId}}/presencas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Gerar ou renovar código secreto (Diretoria)
POST {{IncludePresenca.Api_HostAddress}}/api/eventos/{{eventoId}}/codigos-checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Registrar check-in (membro autenticado)
POST {{IncludePresenca.Api_HostAddress}}/api/eventos/{{eventoId}}/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "123456"
}

### Confirmar presença manualmente (Diretoria)
PATCH {{IncludePresenca.Api_HostAddress}}/api/eventos/{{eventoId}}/presencas/{{membroId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Present",
  "justification": null
}

### Corrigir presença finalizada (Diretoria)
PATCH {{IncludePresenca.Api_HostAddress}}/api/eventos/{{eventoId}}/presencas/{{membroId}}/correcao
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "Present",
  "administrativeReason": "Lista assinada conferida pela Diretoria",
  "checkedInAtUtc": "2026-11-11T13:00:00Z"
}
